<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Jan 27.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Jan 27.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Feed wheat to South Humberside Feb 96.00 Mar 97.00/96.50</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk Feb 96.00 Mar 97.00</p>
<p>Bedfordshire. Buckinghamshire, Northamptonshire and Oxfordshire Feb 92.50 Mar 93.50</p>
<p>Southampton Jan 94.00</p>
<p>Cardiff Jan 95.00</p>
<p>Liverpool Feb 96.50</p>
<p>Feed barley to Norfolk/Suffolk Feb 96.00</p>
</text>
